#: ../../source/templates_kraken.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_kraken.md:18
msgid ""
"Kraken's website is a clean, trustworthy crypto exchange that uses purple"
" as its commanding brand color. The design operates on white backgrounds "
"with Kraken Purple (`#7132f5`, `#5741d8`, `#5b1ecf`) creating a "
"distinctive, professional crypto identity. The proprietary Kraken-Brand "
"font handles display headings with bold (700) weight and negative "
"tracking, while Kraken-Product (with IBM Plex Sans fallback) serves as "
"the UI workhorse."
msgstr ""

